	(text_box "Notes\n1. Default off: EN is low until the host drives it (pull-down R201 in blk.header).\n2. Absent state: see the interface table. Nothing floats; nothing is back-powered.\n3. Measurement: R102 is a 1 Ω link in the full variant and 0 Ω in production;\n   TP101 and TP102 are its Kelvin pads (RFC 0011 rule 3).\n4. C101 and C102 follow the TPS22919 data sheet's typical application\n   (section not cited here: UNVERIFIED).\n5. Unless noted: resistors 1 %; capacitors X5R or X7R, rated at least twice the rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
